From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DockSeed <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 05:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: sound: allwinner: add the A733 I2S, S/PDIF and DMIC

The A733's audio blocks are register-compatible with blocks the bindings
already describe, compared field by field against the A733 UM V1.00
chapter 17:

- I2S/PCM: the R329 register file (CTL, FMT0/1, FCTL, INT, CLKD, CHCFG,
  TXn/RX channel select and map), plus an ASRC block at
  0x80 on I2S2 only, which resets disabled.
- OWA: the H616 S/PDIF block. CTL bit 2 is LOOP here where the H616 has
  MCLKOUTEN; the driver never writes that bit.
- DMIC: the H6 block.

Each gets a SoC compatible with the existing one as fallback.

Assisted-by: Claude
---
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun4i-a10-i2s.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun4i-a10-i2s.yaml
@@ -33,7 +33,9 @@ properties:
       - const: allwinner,sun50i-h6-i2s
       - const: allwinner,sun50i-r329-i2s
       - items:
-          - const: allwinner,sun20i-d1-i2s
+          - enum:
+              - allwinner,sun20i-d1-i2s
+              - allwinner,sun60i-a733-i2s
           - const: allwinner,sun50i-r329-i2s
 
   reg:
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun4i-a10-spdif.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun4i-a10-spdif.yaml
@@ -29,6 +29,9 @@ properties:
       - items:
           - const: allwinner,sun50i-a64-spdif
           - const: allwinner,sun8i-h3-spdif
+      - items:
+          - const: allwinner,sun60i-a733-spdif
+          - const: allwinner,sun50i-h616-spdif
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun50i-h6-dmic.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun50i-h6-dmic.yaml
@@ -18,6 +18,7 @@ properties:
       - items:
           - enum:
               - allwinner,sun20i-d1-dmic
+              - allwinner,sun60i-a733-dmic
           - const: allwinner,sun50i-h6-dmic
       - const: allwinner,sun50i-h6-dmic
 
